From bd3f45fe2e0658ab6de2fc9484316f3c7ba96e9f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "EMA (Cardinal Health EDS docs)" <noreply@localhost>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 21:31:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] feat: add support-carousel + Kaltura video support (real
 SAP assets)

- support-carousel: accessible Prev/Next + dots carousel (scroll-snap) for
  Features and Additional Resources, matching the source carousels. Cards
  carry images with explicit width/height + lazy (no CLS).
- support-video: now supports Kaltura (partnerId/entryId) as well as YouTube,
  lazy click-to-load, so the demo uses SAP's real Kaltura video.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
